rchitect of the Elks Club Building.\", \"answer\": \"Carl A. Gregory\", \"quote\": \"[ 1 ] History [ edit ] It is a three-story , two-part commercial block designed by Tyler architect Carl A. Gregory ( 1903–1976 ) and constructed by Tyler contractor Hugh E.\", \"original_document_number\": 5}]}"
